{
    "title": "Kiss: Read & Write Romance",
    "description": "KISS: Read & Write Romance is the premiere app for the best serialized fiction in the world! \r\n\r\nOur stories feature high-stakes drama and heart-stopping romances. From billionaires to bad boys, werewolves to sports stars, Kiss features the kinds of stories that will sweep you away. Our authors are New York Times and USA Today Bestselling authors, Indie and TikTok superstars and the best emerging authors from across the globe. \r\n\r\nCome discover your next new obsession\u2014we have thousands of books and authors to choose from. Download and start reading for free now!\r\n\r\nKiss features stories of all genres along with heat levels to match however naughty or nice you\u2019re feeling. So indulge your fantasies. And be sure to check out some of our fan-favorite stories:\r\n\r\nForbidden Temptation: My Mafia Fiance's Alpha Father\r\n\u201cChamomile, lavender,\u201d he murmurs, closing his eyes, taking in my scent. \r\n\u201cSo fresh and clean\u2026untainted by the scent of another wolf.\u201d Then he opens his eyes and stares into my bewildered face, wanting to see my reaction as he says, \u201cYou must be a virgin.\u201d\r\nMy lip trembles. \r\nHis eyes eat me up, savoring the quiver of my lips, my wide, terrified eyes.\r\nI swear I feel his tongue flick over my pulse point, hear his low groan.\r\n\u201cSo innocent, so pure\u2026\u201d His grip tightens, and even confined by silver that should keep it from happening, his wolf flashes in his eyes. \u201cTwo of my favorite things to destroy.\u201d\r\n\r\nSnatched a Billionaire to be My Husband\r\nHer scumbag fianc\u00e9 ended their engagement after her family went bankrupt.\r\nSeeking solace, she went to a bar and ended up sleeping with the wealthiest man in the country, coincidentally, also that scumbag's uncle.\r\nInitially, he insisted it was a mistake and had no intention of maintaining any further connection with her.\r\nHowever, he couldn't resist lending a hand whenever she needed financial assistance or when she faced humiliation from that scumbag and his new girlfriend. Then she tricked him into marriage by faking a pregnancy, to seek revenge against her ex, and surprisingly, find happiness in their marriage.\r\nYet, she constantly lived in fear of her secret being exposed.\r\n\r\nMated to the Alpha and His Beta\r\nI\u2019ve been dreading my eighteenth birthday for as long as I can remember.\r\nMy mating day was even worse than I could have imagined.\r\nNot only was I mated to the Alpha and the Beta, they don\u2019t want me, and everyone in the pack knows it. \r\nInstead, they want another girl. And they\u2019ll do whatever it takes to have her.\r\n\r\nKidnapped By My Fated Mate\r\nBella Malum leads a perfectly normal life given her upbringing. But after being convinced to submit a DNA test to determine where her long-lost parents came from, her entire world shifts. Somehow, she\u2019s a powerful psi who was promised to a Domini prince...as his mate.\r\nDominic\u2014AKA Nic\u2014Regnum is the century old leader who has waited years to meet, and claim Bella. And he is less than thrilled when she refuses to come quietly. But Nic holds information back from her\u2014information that changes everything she thought she knew about her past, present, and future.\r\n\r\nWant to be part of our Community?\r\nAre you a writer looking for a way to connect with readers? We\u2019re always looking for authors to share their stories. Through our talented team of professional editors, copyeditors, artists and publicists and marketing strategists, we\u2019ll elevate your voice and support your creativity.",
    "descriptionHTML": "KISS: Read &amp; Write Romance is the premiere app for the best serialized fiction in the world! <br><br>Our stories feature high-stakes drama and heart-stopping romances. From billionaires to bad boys, werewolves to sports stars, Kiss features the kinds of stories that will sweep you away. Our authors are New York Times and USA Today Bestselling authors, Indie and TikTok superstars and the best emerging authors from across the globe. <br><br>Come discover your next new obsession\u2014we have thousands of books and authors to choose from. Download and start reading for free now!<br><br>Kiss features stories of all genres along with heat levels to match however naughty or nice you\u2019re feeling. So indulge your fantasies. And be sure to check out some of our fan-favorite stories:<br><br>Forbidden Temptation: My Mafia Fiance&#39;s Alpha Father<br>\u201cChamomile, lavender,\u201d he murmurs, closing his eyes, taking in my scent. <br>\u201cSo fresh and clean\u2026untainted by the scent of another wolf.\u201d Then he opens his eyes and stares into my bewildered face, wanting to see my reaction as he says, \u201cYou must be a virgin.\u201d<br>My lip trembles. <br>His eyes eat me up, savoring the quiver of my lips, my wide, terrified eyes.<br>I swear I feel his tongue flick over my pulse point, hear his low groan.<br>\u201cSo innocent, so pure\u2026\u201d His grip tightens, and even confined by silver that should keep it from happening, his wolf flashes in his eyes. \u201cTwo of my favorite things to destroy.\u201d<br><br>Snatched a Billionaire to be My Husband<br>Her scumbag fianc\u00e9 ended their engagement after her family went bankrupt.<br>Seeking solace, she went to a bar and ended up sleeping with the wealthiest man in the country, coincidentally, also that scumbag&#39;s uncle.<br>Initially, he insisted it was a mistake and had no intention of maintaining any further connection with her.<br>However, he couldn&#39;t resist lending a hand whenever she needed financial assistance or when she faced humiliation from that scumbag and his new girlfriend. Then she tricked him into marriage by faking a pregnancy, to seek revenge against her ex, and surprisingly, find happiness in their marriage.<br>Yet, she constantly lived in fear of her secret being exposed.<br><br>Mated to the Alpha and His Beta<br>I\u2019ve been dreading my eighteenth birthday for as long as I can remember.<br>My mating day was even worse than I could have imagined.<br>Not only was I mated to the Alpha and the Beta, they don\u2019t want me, and everyone in the pack knows it. <br>Instead, they want another girl. And they\u2019ll do whatever it takes to have her.<br><br>Kidnapped By My Fated Mate<br>Bella Malum leads a perfectly normal life given her upbringing. But after being convinced to submit a DNA test to determine where her long-lost parents came from, her entire world shifts. Somehow, she\u2019s a powerful psi who was promised to a Domini prince...as his mate.<br>Dominic\u2014AKA Nic\u2014Regnum is the century old leader who has waited years to meet, and claim Bella. And he is less than thrilled when she refuses to come quietly. But Nic holds information back from her\u2014information that changes everything she thought she knew about her past, present, and future.<br><br>Want to be part of our Community?<br>Are you a writer looking for a way to connect with readers? We\u2019re always looking for authors to share their stories. Through our talented team of professional editors, copyeditors, artists and publicists and marketing strategists, we\u2019ll elevate your voice and support your creativity.",
